# Meta (Facebook/Instagram) Lead Ads — used to sync leads into the admin panel.
# Get the access token and lead form ID from Meta Business Suite / Graph API Explorer.
# Note: Page access tokens from the Graph API Explorer are short-lived (expire in
# hours/days) — for production use, exchange it for a long-lived or System User token.
